#: faaf26ed7e104170bcebb4e67465a040
msgid ""
"If the flight-control is not receiving telemetry signals from every ESC, and"
" it is unarmed it reinitializes the ESCs until every ESC is configured "
"correctly. The FTW mask is used to determine the motor count that must be "
"found. Double check if the :ref:`SERVO_FTW_MASK<SERVO_FTW_MASK>` is "
"calculated correctly to fit the actual motor count."
msgstr ""
"如果飞控未收到每个 ESC 的数传信号且处于未解锁状态，它将重新初始化 ESC，直到每个 ESC 都正确配置。FTW "
"掩码用于确定必须发现的电机数量。请仔细检查 :ref:`SERVO_FTW_MASK<SERVO_FTW_MASK>` 是否与实际电机数量正确对应。"

